      tell("\"Frankly, I found it unconvincing. I don't see why a ghost would grope about on the floor to find something -- especially in a spot that wasn't even built when the ", D(GHOST_OLD), " was walled up in the tower. Besides, why should a ghost be scared away by a human being? It's usually the opposite, is it not?... No, ");
